{"id":"bb08f01f5311762f","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness.md","title":"Joint Provability Completeness of GLB in Analysis","display":"thm-glb-analysis-completeness — Joint Provability Completeness of GLB in Analysis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness"],"display":"thm-glb-analysis-completeness — Joint Provability Completeness of GLB in Analysis","depends_on":["[[89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-glsb-logic]]","[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-glb-analysis-completeness — Joint Provability Completeness of GLB in Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43a8d98c9b5fc94d\" href=\"?note=43a8d98c9b5fc94d\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization\">89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d60c56f59d86adad\" href=\"?note=d60c56f59d86adad\" title=\"89-df-glsb-logic\">89-df-glsb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"508219e8b4c7dadf\" href=\"?note=508219e8b4c7dadf\" title=\"89-df-analysis-omega-theory\">89-df-analysis-omega-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}\\)</span> 取既有双模态定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"508219e8b4c7dadf\" href=\"?note=508219e8b4c7dadf\" title=\"89-df-analysis-omega-theory\">89-df-analysis-omega-theory</a> 定义的普通分析闭句定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_2\">\\(\\mathcal N_2\\)</span> 为标准满二阶自然数结构，各元数关系域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)\\)</span>，数域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；采用此结构下分析与完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则的可靠性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\)</span>，翻译使用同一个原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLB}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLSB}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\mathcal N_2\\models\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLB}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLSB}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\mathcal N_2\\models\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 p.218，Theorem（证明纲要引用第 14–15 章）。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>这是原书 p.218 的 Theorem，第一目标为普通分析可证性，真值目标为标准二阶结构。作者给出从第 15 章双模态证明移植第 14 章分析构造的说明，本条保存该来源支持的定理陈述；没有把原书只给出的证明纲要写成已独立展开的全部证明。</p>\n<p>与单模态分析完全性相比，这里同时保留两个算子及其交互模式；标准 PA 中一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 谓词不能替代二阶分析的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization","status":"resolved","id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glsb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"d60c56f59d86adad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glsb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}$ 取既有双模态定理集；$\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})$ 是 [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] 定义的普通分析闭句定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLB}&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\in\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLSB}&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\mathcal N_2\\models\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false}],"bytes":2074,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"分析：[[89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness]]。"}],"outgoing":["43a8d98c9b5fc94d","5a9efa2261b8f73c","d60c56f59d86adad","508219e8b4c7dadf"]}